  "post_title": "I torneo de gimnasia artística Víctor Cabedo en su pabellón de Onda",
  "post_date": "2013-06-30 14:09:46",
  "post_name": "i-torneo-de-gimnasia-artistica-victor-cabedo-en-su-pabellon-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_5097.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda ha acogido la ma&ntilde;ana de este domingo el I torneo con su nombre, organizado por el Club Gym-Sport Onda. Han participado tambi&eacute;n los clubs de Almassora y Benic&agrave;ssim. Han entregado los trofeos Paula Mas Iserte, reina infantil de la Fira 2012 y tambi&eacute;n gimnasta, y los concejales de Deportes y Nuevas Tecnolog&iacute;as, Jos&eacute; Manuel Alfonso Broch y Jos&eacute; Vicente Iserte Ib&aacute;&ntilde;ez, repsectivamente.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneogimnasiartisticavictorcabedocarda/img_5030.jpg\" alt=\"img_5030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneogimnasiartisticavictorcabedocarda/img_5031.jpg\" alt=\"img_5031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneogimnasiartisticavictorcabedocarda/img_5032.jpg\" alt=\"img_5032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneogimnasiartisticavictorcabedocarda/img_5033.jpg\" alt=\"img_5033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneogimnasiartisticavictorcabedocarda/img_5034.jpg\" alt=\"img_5034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneogimnasiartisticavictorcabedocarda/img_5035.jpg\" alt=\"img_5035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneogimnasiartisticavictorcabedocarda/img_5036.jpg\" alt=\"img_5036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25